These PNG files are fan tributes: small pixel reinterpretations that nod to the
works each themed look is inspired by. The characters, designs and marks they
evoke belong to their respective owners. tidalamp is not affiliated with,
sponsored by, or endorsed by any of them.

These files are NOT covered by tidalamp's licence (GPL-3.0-or-later). The GPL
applies to tidalamp's code and to everything else in this repository; it does
not, and cannot, grant any rights over these characters or designs. If you
redistribute or modify tidalamp, these pictures carry no licence from us.

If you hold rights over something here and want it removed, open an issue at
https://github.com/wh01s17/tidalamp/issues and it will be taken out in the
next release. Nothing depends on them: `backdrop = "none"` turns them off, and
the player works the same without the files.
